@AspNetLearning.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5135

### Tüm ürünleri getir

GET {{AspNetLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json


### Yeni ürün ekle

POST {{AspNetLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mekanik Klavye",
  "price": 1250.50,
  "stock": 10
}
### 2 numaralı ürünü getir

GET {{AspNetLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/2
Accept: application/json


### 2 numaralı ürünü güncelle

PUT {{AspNetLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RGB Mekanik Klavye",
  "price": 1750.75,
  "stock": 7
}


### 1 numaralı ürünü sil

DELETE {{AspNetLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1